摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"view modes for deepseek harness, including Verbose, Normal, Summary Mode","id":"gh:1333441087","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-view-modes","slug":"NigelYao/dsh-view-modes","topics":["ai-agent","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","deepseek-harness-plugin-dev","deepseek-harness-plugins","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","viewmode"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"view modes for deepseek harness, including Verbose, Normal, Summary Mode"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DshViewModes"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Three output modes for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web: Verbose, Normal, and Summary. Keep the full trace"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" when debugging, reduce process noise during daily work, or focus on the result."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"This is an official-style DSH bundle plugin (`dsh.bundle` + `dsh.client`). It changes only browser-s"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ide presentation and does not patch DSH core files."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The interface follows the language selected in Harness Settings. This is Normal mode with Harness se"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" follows the language selected in Harness Settings. This is Normal mode with Harness set to English:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Normal mode groups related tool calls and thinking while keeping assistant text as a clear boundary."},{"id":"p8s2","text":" Click a process title to inspect its original steps."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Switch modes from the session header."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Modes"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Mode | Best for | Behavior |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| **Verbose** | Debugging | Preserves everything DSH renders, including thinking, tool calls, retrie"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"s, context, and statistics |\n| **Normal** | Daily work | Groups process steps by semantic phase; thi"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"nking joins the neighboring process group; assistant text remains visible and starts a new grouping "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"interval |\n| **Summary** | Results | Hides process noise while running, shows a live shimmer status,"},{"id":"p12s5","text":" and folds the completed process into a compact summary |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Normal mode does not split a group after an arbitrary number of calls. Repeated reads, commands, edi"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ts, searches, or coordination steps can stay together while they belong to the same phase. A visible"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" assistant message is always a hard boundary."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Requirements:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- Node.js 20 or later\n- DSH with the `web` profile available\n- Git\n- `pnpm` on `PATH` (required by `"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"dsh plugin`; use `corepack enable` if needed)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Public GitHub install (recommended)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"No npm account is required:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Local development on Windows"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"For source iteration, clone the repository onto the same drive as the DSH home directory. This avoid"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"s broken cross-drive package links."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"If you already keep the repository on another drive, create a junction on the DSH home drive and ins"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"tall from the junction:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Do not insert `dsh-view-modes` again in the profile or home `cordis.patch.yml`; the plugin's own pat"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ch already registers its bundle id."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Start DSH Web"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Restart DSH Web after installing or updating the plugin. The client bundle revision is composed when"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" the process starts."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Open http://127.0.0.1:3080/."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Use"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- Use the session-header control to select **Verbose**, **Normal**, or **Summary**.\n- Use `Alt+1`, `"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"Alt+2`, or `Alt+3` to switch modes from the keyboard.\n- In Normal mode, click a process title such a"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"s \"Ran 2 commands, thought 3 times\" to expand the original steps. Click the title row again to colla"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"pse it.\n- Individual command details remain expandable inside an open process group. Closing the gro"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"up resets those details, so the next opening starts compact.\n- The selected mode is stored in `local"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"Storage` and survives refresh. The default is **Normal**.\n- All UI copy follows the language selecte"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"d in Harness Settings and updates between Chinese and English automatically.\n- The running process t"},{"id":"p31s8","text":"itle uses a shimmer effect, and changing counters roll upward."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Summary mode shows a compact live activity line while the agent runs. When the turn completes, the p"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"rocess becomes an expandable recap above the answer."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Update"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Verify"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The configuration should mention `dsh-view-modes` once, and http://127.0.0.1:3080/plugins/dsh-view-m"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"odes/client.js should return HTTP 200 while DSH Web is running."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- Technical notes (Chinese): architecture, grouping rules, data attributes, performance constraints,"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" and maintenance notes"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
